  "description": "<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> An artisan can spend their Reaction to provide a 1d4 modifier on a Thieves' Tools check, with separate options for failed and successful checks. The fail/success selectors need a numeric DC; replace thief if the installed D&D 5e system uses a different tool identifier.</p><p><strong>Setup:</strong> Drag this Active Effect onto the actor who should own the External Reaction option. All changes use Override mode. Confirm the installed D&amp;D 5e tool identifier before use. Test the feature in a disposable world before adding it to a live character.</p>",
